file crates/cli/src/failure.rs
symbol Failure
lines 0 36
hash 4683e651f97d93b1
note Every way a command can fail, as data: exec returns one and wire.rs's Display words it, so the message text lives in one file and tests can match the variant. Map wraps the domain's MapError; Load, Save and Parse wrap io-map's errors; the rest are the CLI's own refusals (no such tour, step, file or symbol, an ambiguous symbol with its candidates, a line range or parent out of bounds, a bad regex, no repository, stale steps for check).

